
### 1. 查询所有文章
GET http://localhost:8080/articles

### 2. 创建新文章
POST http://localhost:8080/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Go后端项目实战",
  "content": "今天学习Gin的POST请求"
}

### 3. 根据 ID 查询文章
GET http://localhost:8080/articles/4

### 4. 测试错误请求
POST http://localhost:8080/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "content": ""
}
